// P3E.2 (essential-tips.md T1.2, X1; test-drive.md TD5.3, TD5.4): a document of 60 tabs
// (`tab-fixture 60`: small Part Studios "Studio 2" …, every fifth an Assembly, every twelfth a
// Drawing). The strip scrolls (wheel, chevrons), ▾ lists the tabs out of sight, the selected
// tab is kept in view, and folders shorten the strip.
// 01 the 60 tabs: the strip starts at Studio 2; the chevrons and ▾ show there are
//    more.
// 02 the wheel over the strip: scrolled a few whole tabs.
// 03 ▾: the tabs out of sight listed (a scrollbar; a separator between those before and after
//    the view; the active tab checked), the 12th hovered.
// 04 it is picked: selected and scrolled into view.
// 05 "+" → Create Part Studio: the new tab ("Part Studio 1", right of it) selected and in view.
// 06 back at the strip's start, Studio 2's menu → Move to folder ▸ New folder, named "First
//    three" in place; Studio 3 and Studio 4 dragged onto it: the folder tab first, then Assembly 1
//    (the fifth tab) ….
// 07 the folder clicked: its list above it (Studio 2, 3, 4, New ▸).
// 08 Studio 3 picked there: opened; the folder tab marked as holding it.
// 09 the strip scrolled to its end with the wheel, the last tab (Drawing 5) clicked: selected
//    and in view.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("tab-fixture 60"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-sixty-tabs"),
        Scroll(ui("tab-strip"), -4),
        Wait(15),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-wheel-scrolled"),
        Click(ui("tab-overflow")),
        WaitFor("tab-overflow-menu"),
        Hover(ui("tab-overflow-12")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("03-overflow-list"),
        Click(ui("tab-overflow-12")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-picked-in-view"),
        Click(ui("insert-tab")),
        WaitFor("insert-tab-menu"),
        Click(ui("create-part-studio")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-new-tab-in-view"),
        Scroll(ui("tab-strip"), 80),
        Wait(10),
        RightClick(ui("tab-studio-2")),
        WaitFor("tab-context-menu"),
        Hover(ui("tab-move-folder")),
        WaitFor("tab-to-new-folder"),
        Click(ui("tab-to-new-folder")),
        WaitFor("tab-folder-rename-field"),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("First three"),
        Key("Enter"),
        WaitFor("tab-folder-first-three"),
        // (The strip keeps the active Part Studio 1 in view when its tabs change: back to its
        // start before each drag.)
        Scroll(ui("tab-strip"), 80),
        Wait(10),
        Drag(ui("tab-studio-3"), ui_at("tab-folder-first-three", 0.5, 0.5)),
        Wait(10),
        Scroll(ui("tab-strip"), 80),
        Wait(10),
        Drag(ui("tab-studio-4"), ui_at("tab-folder-first-three", 0.5, 0.5)),
        Wait(10),
        Scroll(ui("tab-strip"), 80),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-strip-with-folder"),
        Click(ui("tab-folder-first-three")),
        WaitFor("tab-folder-list"),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("07-folder-list"),
        Click(ui("tab-folder-pick-studio-3")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-picked-from-folder"),
        Scroll(ui("tab-strip"), -80),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("tab-drawing-5")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-last-tab-in-view"),
    ],
)
